Supply the evaluation materials for DeepSeek-V4-Flash (eval/deepseek_v4_flash)

The checking and measurement code the grader uses for this task, with small
examples: the maintainers' acceptance test and the server-sanity kit it
imports (verbatim), an adapter for them, the native-support, served-recipe,
accuracy, speculation and regression checks, the log-probability fidelity and
prefix-cache protocols, and the efficiency client with its natural-text
sample. See eval/deepseek_v4_flash/README.md.
